Data Science Interview Landscape

The areas on which the Interviewers evaluate the skills of an interviewee

1.  Python  ------------->   Python is used by the data science interviewer to test the coding skills of a data science interviewee and even his problem solving ability.

2.  SQL     ------------->   SQL is used by the data science interviewer to test the ability o an interveiwee of how well can he easily handle and manipulate with the data. It also checks the analytical skills of the interviewee of how well can he analyze the data using SQL.

3.  Statistics ---------->   Statistics is used by the data science interviewer to test the reasoning ability of the data science interviewee of how well can he derieve the conclusions from the problem statements. It is used for Statistical reasoning.

4.  ML        ----------->  ML is used by the data science interviewer to test how well the interviewee can solve the real world scenario with the help of an algorithm and improve the accuracy of that algorithm.

5.  Projects   ----------> Projects are used as an actual proof by the data science interviewee to showcase its skills to the data science interviewer abd even explain him of how well you have used all these skills in the real world problem.

6.  Case studies ---------> These are the real world problems that are provided by the interviewer  to the interviewee, so that the interviewee can solve the real world problem during the interview round and derieve some business insights from the case study problem. These business insights can be very useful to the stakeholders. Thus by solving multiple number of business case studies,out business thinking ability also increases.

7.  GenAI ------------->  It is used by data science interviewer and the interviewer asks all the basic concepts to the interviewee to ensure that the interviewee knows about the modern AI techniques.

8.  Communication ---------> The data science interviewer also tests the communication ability of an interviewee to make sure that whatever concepts the interviewee explains , he must able to communicate properly with proper english. It will even tell about his command over english and his throughness and grip on that particular topic.